284","p":12,"im":["f8e4901ea8c4b4297a3b229078d40f73df8b6c14","68f97a4e2972f89f8c2df9d91798e3f196b5332a","ec3160b4921dd9ad3113ac8f3693f2d06079f49a"],"m":284},{"id":"aboutcompression_p12_285","t":"Result: 38-CP's\n\n19-20:\n\n20-20:","a":"Red Knight","d":"","n":"#285","p":12,"im":["2748a277c7fca9ad32a5527178cc973e5b44c14d","82045ccdd6a5a933ba9197db4693b7761ded12d6","ecc95b7f760829cab34aa46200cb0703af1a8d96","0cd96b49451f8e10efd2b5eba29cacf6d6131c8d"],"m":285},{"id":"aboutcompression_p12_286","t":"Result: 40-CP's\n\nTarget:20 examples reached and I think I understand this subject and can spot on my charts.I will mastering CP and CP-LQ in my next HW sections. This thread I am closing.\n\n24:\n\n25:\n\n26:\n\n27:\n\n28:\n\n29:","a":"Red Knight","d":"","n":"#286","p":12,"im":["5129f9a2473c4f7178a942665b7cdf2d822cc9fa","8812061c0051f108c81a6bd017690891d0bbcf19","de6fbab612bdfa8a3a6d8de0dad23549846a6772","3e6bdddaff897f11921b666d4dc4409b90977ba3","1e2654bbf1c8a86282b62fc54fa495d65abf28c5","04aec131c57f9ad54d0dcedc49de3c190c6a5e7e"],"m":286},{"id":"aboutcompression_p12_287","t":"HI chaps, Just found out about this site and so far am very impressed. This is my first attempt at spotting compression. All criticism welcomed. Please let me know if I'm close and especially if I either missed some or added ones that aren't really cp. Much obliged. Oh! The chart is daily cable.","a":"Oedipus99","d":"","n":"#287","p":12,"im":["e02ca5a0fefb43fc7ed9457278a766784f015af7"],"m":287},{"id":"aboutcompression_p12_288","t":"These two look more like flags to me now. I think, I dunno!","a":"Oedipus99","d":"","n":"#288","p":12,"im":["00f54253d8497257045f47cd7d8f846b63450260"],"m":288},{"id":"aboutcompression_p12_289","t":"Few more examples (I hope). Think this chart colour is easier to see too.","a":"Oedipus99","d":"","n":"#289","p":12,"im":["264c29d47d3df3ca19428a0772cca1b7afdb94a6"],"m":289},{"id":"aboutcompression_p12_290","t":"Hi Oedipus\n\nWhat I'd like to be sure of is that you notice what happens to price once it enters a cp zone.\n\nBest\n\nIf","a":"Ifmyante","d":"","n":"#290","p":12,"im":[],"m":290},{"id":"aboutcompression_p12_291","t":"Eats up pending s/d orders providing liquidity?","a":"Oedipus99","d":"","n":"#291","p":12,"im":["f9672ed634cd3ad166ef873a3cfee231000625eb"],"m":291},{"id":"aboutcompression_p12_292","t":"To be more specific when price enters the cp zone on the way down it's triggering previous demand orders. Forming longer candle wicks (shadows) on the bottom than the top. When price then runs back up through these areas there's little to stop it in the way of previous orders, giving it real momentum (legs). Am I right? Please be as critical as possible, it's really important I understand WHY price moves like it does.","a":"Oedipus99","d":"","n":"#292","p":12,"im":[],"m":292},{"id":"aboutcompression_p12_293","t":"Thanks for all you do.... Do you ever sleep? I know asked and answered!","a":"Nosbigs","d":"","n":"#293","p":12,"im":[],"m":293},{"id":"aboutcompression_p12_294","t":"Nosbigs wrote: Thanks for all you do.... Do you ever sleep? I know asked and answered!\n\nI know mate, I got kind of into it yesterday. This is H4 Euro","a":"Oedipus99","d":"","n":"#294","p":12,"im":["456b4b31450606003c8b40ac00dd3446e86c71cd"],"m":294},{"id":"aboutcompression_p12_295","t":"This is daily Euro. Much easier to see how all the cp points led to a bullish lq","a":"Oedipus99","d":"","n":"#295","p":12,"im":[],"m":295},{"id":"aboutcompression_p12_296","t":"This is daily Euro. Much easier to see how all the cp points led to a bullish lq pole. If, I'm starting to see what you mean about price thinking ahead.","a":"Oedipus99","d":"","n":"#296","p":12,"im":["47600aac908518620677a00dbb6c2e1d11b0d924"],"m":296},{"id":"aboutcompression_p12_297","t":"Monthly Aussie dollar.","a":"Oedipus99","d":"","n":"#297","p":12,"im":["9242a7b48e7f1e300495eb897e9941aa51c35d95"],"m":297},{"id":"aboutcompression_p12_298","t":"Could've made a couple bucks on this move.","a":"O